{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Tune_counts</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"neural_nets_lib","href":"../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Tune_counts","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-count\"><a href=\"#type-count\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> count</span><span> = </span><span>[ </span></code><ol><li id=\"type-count.Reached\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-count.Reached\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Reached</span></code></li><li id=\"type-count.Admitted\" class=\"def variant constructor anchored\"><a href=\"#type-count.Admitted\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>| </span><span>`Admitted</span></code></li></ol><code><span> ]</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-departures\"><a href=\"#val-departures\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> departures : <span><a href=\"#type-count\">count</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"../../arrayjit/Autotune/index.html#type-report\">Autotune.report</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span>string <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.List.t</span></span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-skipped_on\"><a href=\"#val-skipped_on\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> skipped_on : string</span></code></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-claim\"><a href=\"#val-claim\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> claim : \u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">count</span>:<a href=\"#type-count\">count</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"label\">tag</span>:string <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span><a href=\"../../arrayjit/Autotune/index.html#type-report\">Autotune.report</a> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.List.t</span> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.String.t <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.bool <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span>\u000A  <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Base</span>.unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>claim ~count ~tag reports label ok</code> is <code>Verdict.p label ok</code> when none of <code>reports</code> records a departure that moves a <code>count</code> claim, and an <code>`Environment</code> skip of <code>label</code> otherwise, with each report's departures on stderr under <code>tag</code> (not part of the golden). A claim comparing two searches passes both reports.</p></div></div>"}